[?2004l[?2004h> # SOP Sections 4 and 5:
[?2004l[?2004h> # 4 Response scale:
[?2004l[?2004h> # response = readout of the well / readout the same well would have given with vehicle only
[?2004l[?2004h> # so that vehicle-treated cells have response 1 for both readouts.
